items.title:
ai.mindconnect:mc-file-store 0.0.3 发布, Id-addressed file storage (OpenAI-Files-API-style): upload once, reference the id
        from chats and vector stores. Backend SPI via ServiceLoader — filesystem ships built-in,
        object storage (s3) or database backends slot in as sibling modules.

